{"id":"ce4025d134acee55","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence.md","title":"Ultrafilter-Based Equivalence","display":"df-ultrafilter-equivalence — Ultrafilter-Based Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence","58-df-ultraproduct-equivalence"],"display":"df-ultrafilter-equivalence — Ultrafilter-Based Equivalence","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-indexed-product]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence</span><span>58-df-ultraproduct-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrafilter-equivalence — Ultrafilter-Based Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72d50169a31e1436\" href=\"?note=72d50169a31e1436\" title=\"58-df-indexed-product\">58-df-indexed-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I \\in V\">\\(I \\in V\\)</span> (指标集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{U}\">\\(\\mathcal{U}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的超滤, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-indexed family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)\">\\(f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)\\)</span> (choice functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"72d50169a31e1436\" href=\"?note=72d50169a31e1436\" title=\"58-df-indexed-product\">58-df-indexed-product</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (equivalence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S(f,g,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S(f,g,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Motivation</strong>: 在超幂构造中，两个函数若在超滤中几乎处处相等，则视为等价</li>\n<li><strong>Quotient</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i / \\mathcal{U} \\coloneqq \\{[f]_{\\mathcal{U}} : f \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\\}\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i / \\mathcal{U} \\coloneqq \\{[f]_{\\mathcal{U}} : f \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\\}\\)</span> where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_{\\mathcal{U}} = \\{g \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i : f \\sim_{\\mathcal{U}} g\\}\">\\([f]_{\\mathcal{U}} = \\{g \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i : f \\sim_{\\mathcal{U}} g\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>The index set and indexed family are explicit arguments; the ultrafilter alone does not determine the ambient product.</li>\n<li>For fixed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)\">\\((\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>, the displayed predicate is an equivalence relation on the indexed product.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-indexed-product","status":"resolved","id":"72d50169a31e1436","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-indexed-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I \\in V$ (指标集, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{U}$ ($I$ 上的超滤, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A$ with $\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I$ ($I$-indexed family, see [[58-df-family]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-indexed-product","status":"resolved","id":"72d50169a31e1436","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)$ (choice functions, see [[58-df-indexed-product]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{U}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrafilterEquivalent}_S(f,g,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal A)=I\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathcal A(i)\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U","display":true},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i / \\mathcal{U} \\coloneqq \\{[f]_{\\mathcal{U}} : f \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_{\\mathcal{U}} = \\{g \\in \\prod_{i \\in I} A_i : f \\sim_{\\mathcal{U}} g\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal A)","display":false}],"bytes":1750,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence.md|58-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","72d50169a31e1436","545b51e7aa011030","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}